3.
Definitions.-
In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires;-
(a)
"Chairman" means the Chairman of the Governing Body;
(b)
"Director" means the Director of the Institute;
(c)
"Fund" means the Fund of the Institute referred to in section 16;
(d)
"Governing Body" means the Governing Body of the Institute;
(e)
"Institute" means the institution known as the Sree Chitra Tirunal Institute for Medical Sciences and Technology,
Trivandrum, incorporated under this Act;
(f)
"member" means a member of the Institute;
(g)
"President" means the President of the Institute;
(h)
"regulation" means a regulation made by the Institute;
(i)
"rule" means a rule made by the Central Government.

(g)
the powers and functions to be exercised and discharged by the Director under sub-section (3) of section 11;
(h)
the tenure of office, salaries and allowances and other conditions of service of the Director and other officers and
